# ☸️ K8s Agent

**LLM-powered Kubernetes Agent** with multi-agent collaboration, MCP protocol, and pluggable skills.

[![Python 3.11+](https://img.shields.io/badge/python-3.11+-blue.svg)](https://www.python.org/)
[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)

---

## 🎯 Features

- **🤖 Multi-Agent Collaboration** — Master Agent orchestrates specialized sub-agents (K8s Agent, Skill Agents) via MessageBus
- **🔌 MCP Protocol** — Built-in K8s MCP Server (30+ tools), can connect to ANY third-party MCP server (GitHub, Postgres, Slack, etc.)
- **🧩 Pluggable Skills** — Hot-loadable skill plugins: 3 built-in + custom skill API
- **💬 Web UI** — Real-time chat interface with streaming responses and tool call visualization
- **🖥️ CLI** — Full-featured command-line interface (serve, run, web, skill, config)
- **🔒 Safe by Default** — Destructive operations require confirmation, secrets are redacted
- **📦 Standalone MCP Server** — The K8s MCP server can be used by ANY MCP client (Claude Desktop, Claude Code, etc.)

---

## 📋 Architecture

```
User (CLI / Web UI / API)
  ↓
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  编排层 (packages/core)                   │
│  MasterAgent → TaskDecomposer → Executor │
│  子Agent: K8sAgent, SkillAgent           │
│  通信: MessageBus + SharedContext         │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
   ↓              ↓              ↓
┌──────┐  ┌──────────┐  ┌──────────────┐
│ LLM  │  │ Skills   │  │ MCP Client   │
│ 层   │  │ 层       │  │ Manager      │
└──────┘  └──────────┘  └──────────────┘
                              ↓ (MCP协议)
                  ┌───────────────────────┐
                  │ K8s MCP Server        │
                  │ 30+ Tools             │
                  └───────────────────────┘
                              ↓
                  ┌───────────────────────┐
                  │ @kubernetes/client    │
                  │ (真实 K8s API)         │
                  └───────────────────────┘
```

