## ⚙️ Configuration Reference

### 完整配置项

```yaml
# k8s-agent.config.yaml
kubernetes:
  auth_mode: kubeconfig      # kubeconfig | in-cluster | token
  kubeconfig_path: ~/.kube/config
  context: null              # 指定kubeconfig context

llm:
  provider: anthropic
  api_key: ${ANTHROPIC_API_KEY}
  model: claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929
  max_tokens: 4096
  temperature: 0.2
  retry_max_retries: 3
  circuit_failure_threshold: 5

mcp_server:
  transport: stdio           # stdio | http
  http_host: 0.0.0.0
  http_port: 3100
  access_control_enabled: true
  allowed_tools: ["*"]
  denied_tools: ["delete_namespace", "drain_node"]

agent:
  max_iterations: 15
  task_timeout_ms: 300000
  parallel_task_limit: 3
  confirmation_required:
    - delete_namespace
    - delete_deployment
    - drain_node

skills:
  paths:
    - ~/.k8s-agent/skills
    - ./.k8s-agent/skills

logging:
  level: info                # trace | debug | info | warn | error
  format: pretty             # pretty | json
```

### 环境变量

| 变量 | 说明 | 默认值 |
|------|------|--------|
| `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` | Anthropic API 密钥 | - |
| `LLM_MODEL` | Claude 模型名 | `claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929` |
| `LLM_MAX_TOKENS` | 最大输出 token | `4096` |
| `K8S_AUTH_MODE` | K8s 认证方式 | `kubeconfig` |
| `K8S_KUBECONFIG_PATH` | Kubeconfig 路径 | `~/.kube/config` |
| `K8S_AGENT_CONFIG` | YAML 配置文件路径 | - |
| `LOG_LEVEL` | 日志级别 | `info` |

