## 📊 MCP Tools Reference

### Namespace Tools
| Tool | Description | Required Params |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| `list_namespaces` | List all namespaces | - |
| `get_namespace` | Get namespace details | `name` |
| `create_namespace` | Create a namespace | `name` |
| `delete_namespace` | Delete a namespace | `name` |

### Pod Tools
| Tool | Description | Required Params |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| `list_pods` | List pods in namespace | `namespace` |
| `get_pod` | Get pod details | `name`, `namespace` |
| `describe_pod` | Full pod description + events | `name`, `namespace` |
| `create_pod` | Create a pod | `name`, `namespace`, `image` |
| `delete_pod` | Delete a pod | `name`, `namespace` |
| `get_pod_logs` | Get pod logs | `name`, `namespace` |
| `exec_in_pod` | Execute command in pod | `name`, `command` |

### Deployment Tools
| Tool | Description | Required Params |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| `list_deployments` | List deployments | `namespace` |
| `get_deployment` | Get deployment details | `name`, `namespace` |
| `create_deployment` | Create a deployment | `name`, `namespace`, `image` |
| `update_deployment` | Update deployment | `name`, `namespace` |
| `delete_deployment` | Delete deployment | `name`, `namespace` |
| `scale_deployment` | Scale replicas | `name`, `namespace`, `replicas` |
| `rollout_status` | Check rollout status | `name`, `namespace` |
| `rollout_undo` | Rollback deployment | `name`, `namespace` |
| `restart_deployment` | Rolling restart | `name`, `namespace` |

### Service Tools
| Tool | Description | Required Params |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| `list_services` | List services | `namespace` |
| `get_service` | Get service details | `name`, `namespace` |
| `create_service` | Create service | `name`, `namespace` |
| `delete_service` | Delete service | `name`, `namespace` |
| `expose_deployment` | Expose deployment as service | `deployment_name`, `namespace` |

### Other Tools
| Tool | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `list_nodes` / `get_node` | Node management |
| `cordon_node` / `uncordon_node` / `drain_node` | Node maintenance |
| `list_events` / `get_resource_events` | Event queries |
| `list_configmaps` / `get_configmap` / `create_configmap` | ConfigMap management |
| `list_secrets` / `get_secret` / `create_secret` | Secret management (values redacted) |
| `list_helm_releases` / `install_helm_chart` / `uninstall_helm_release` | Helm management |
| `get_cluster_info` / `get_node_metrics` / `get_pod_metrics` | Cluster info and metrics |
| `api_resources` / `apply_manifest` | API discovery and manifest apply |

